{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"杨--Mills泛函"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“杨–Mills 泛函”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>设 $M$ 是 Riemann 流形, $\\mathfrak g$ 是 Lie 代数. Yang–Mills 泛函是取值在"},{"Local":{"url":"联络","text":"联络"}},{"Plain":"上的泛函\n$$\r\n\\mathcal L = \\|F\\|^2,\r\n$$\n其中 $F$ 是联络对应的"},{"Local":{"url":"曲率","text":"曲率"}},{"Plain":", $\\|-\\|$ 来源于 $\\Omega^2(M,\\mathfrak g)$ 上的一个内积.</p>\n<p>$$\r\nS=\\int \\mathcal L \\,\\text{dVol} = -\\int F\\wedge\\star F\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>规范不变性</h2>\n<p>“完美 Morse 函数”</p>\n<p>其临界点为 "},{"Local":{"url":"杨--Mills联络","text":"杨–Mills 联络"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>与全纯向量丛的联系</h2>\n<p>辛几何与"},{"Local":{"url":"动量映射","text":"动量映射"}},{"Plain":"将杨–Mills 泛函与"},{"Local":{"url":"全纯向量丛","text":"全纯向量丛"}},{"Plain":"联系起来. 杨–Mills 理论可用于研究丛的"},{"Local":{"url":"模空间","text":"模空间"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}